From: Sapphire Port <sapphire@xiaomi>
Subject: [PATCH] sapphire-26-0101: XNU 26.1 kernel audit fixes (early FB PA, TBI/LDAPRS* emulation, GPU timer/16K align, scale2 CPU fallback, MDP/cam/BT/FAT fixes)

---
